{
    "title": "UNIQLO US - Clothes Shopping",
    "description": "Discover effortless shopping and effortless style \u2014 all with the UNIQLO app. Explore the latest clothing collaborations, inspire your style with fresh fashion ideas, and claim exclusive app-only deals. From timeless LifeWear and streetwear favorites to winter HEATTECH thermal layers and breathable AIRism lines for warmer days, be the first to know when the clothes you love most are back in stock. \r\n\r\n\r\nComplete your wardrobe with everyday denim jeans and essential accessories for your home and redefine your fashion shopping experience with the app that brings you the best of UNIQLO. \r\n\r\n\r\n\u2728 Inspire your clothing\r\n\r\n\r\nBrowse styles shared by customers, influencers, and UNIQLO staff members from all over the world and get inspiration for your next outfit. \r\n\r\n\r\nFind ideas for women\u2019s and men\u2019s clothing and shop practical, stylish clothes collections for all ages and seasons. \r\n\r\n\r\nDiscover online-exclusive sizes and clothing styles you won\u2019t find anywhere else.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc66\ud83e\uddd2Kids\u2019 fashion and baby clothes\r\nDiscover stylish and comfortable clothing for the little ones. \r\n\r\n\r\nFrom playful and durable everyday kids\u2019 clothing like jeans, t-shirts, and shorts, to soft and gentle fabrics perfect for newborns, UNIQLO has just what you need for your kids\u2019 wardrobes. \r\n\r\n\r\nShop seasonal kids\u2019 clothing collections, featuring streetwear-inspired designs and limited-edition collaborations, all exclusive to UNIQLO.\r\n\r\n\r\n \ud83d\udc5a\ud83d\udc55Save your favorite clothing styles \r\n\r\n\r\nTag clothes you like as \u201cFavorites\u201d and keep a collection of looks you love.\r\n\r\n\r\nGet notified when items you\u2019ve tagged as favorites are available for pickup, back in stock, or on sale.\r\n\r\n\r\nKeep adding your favorite clothes to your collection for more personalized style recommendations.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa5Clothes-sizing videos \r\n\r\n\r\nSee styles up close with product videos that give you a detailed look at the cut and fabric, giving you a more realistic idea of how clothes fit. \r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udccfMySize ASSIST\r\n\r\n\r\nTake the guesswork out of sizing with MySize Assistant.\r\n\r\n\r\nSimply enter your body measurements and preferred fit, and we\u2019ll recommend a clothing size that\u2019s perfect for you.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfecEasy in-store pickups\r\n \r\nSave on shipping costs and skip store queues when you shop for clothes and other products using the app. \r\n\r\n\r\nChoose \"Ship to Store\" on your checkout screen and collect your new styles from any UNIQLO store that suits you within 1 hour, completely free of charge. \r\n\r\n\r\nSee when products are out of stock online but available in-store and swing by for a swift, same-day pick-up. \r\n\r\n\r\nAvoid the disappointment of a wasted trip by checking whether a new product or special offer item is in stock before you visit your favorite store.\r\n\r\n\r\n\u23f0Back-in-stock notifications\r\n\r\n\r\nGet alerts sent straight to your phone and be the first to know when the clothing style you\u2019ve been eyeing is back in stock.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0eUNIQLO product scanner\r\n\r\n\r\nUse the app to scan product barcodes at home or in store and easily check if nearby stores have your perfect size and fit. \r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd11 App-exclusive offers  \r\n\r\n\r\nDownload UNIQLO and unlock $10 off your first purchase of $75 or more\u2014new customers only.\r\nScan your app member ID at checkout to unlock exclusive, member-only discounts. \r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf33 Save time\u2014and the planet\u2014with e-receipts\r\n\r\n\r\nOpt for e-receipts at checkout to easily track your shopping history right from the app.\r\n\r\n\r\nReturn or exchange clothing and other items using electronic receipts, saving you the hassle of keeping track of paper receipts.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce3Have your say\r\n\r\n\r\nShare feedback on items you\u2019ve bought with the UNIQLO team and keep a lookout for product improvements. \r\n\r\n\r\nRead reviews from customers who have bought the same products as you. See the star rating, gender, height, weight and age of the customer who posted the review to help you choose the perfect product.\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2139\ufe0f UNIQLO customer care\r\n\r\n\r\nChat with a UNIQLO representative for assistance with all your clothes and shopping needs.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Discover effortless shopping and effortless style \u2014 all with the UNIQLO app. Explore the latest clothing collaborations, inspire your style with fresh fashion ideas, and claim exclusive app-only deals. From timeless LifeWear and streetwear favorites to winter HEATTECH thermal layers and breathable AIRism lines for warmer days, be the first to know when the clothes you love most are back in stock. <br><br><br>Complete your wardrobe with everyday denim jeans and essential accessories for your home and redefine your fashion shopping experience with the app that brings you the best of UNIQLO. <br><br><br>\u2728 Inspire your clothing<br><br><br>Browse styles shared by customers, influencers, and UNIQLO staff members from all over the world and get inspiration for your next outfit. <br><br><br>Find ideas for women\u2019s and men\u2019s clothing and shop practical, stylish clothes collections for all ages and seasons. <br><br><br>Discover online-exclusive sizes and clothing styles you won\u2019t find anywhere else.<br><br><br>\ud83d\udc66\ud83e\uddd2Kids\u2019 fashion and baby clothes<br>Discover stylish and comfortable clothing for the little ones. <br><br><br>From playful and durable everyday kids\u2019 clothing like jeans, t-shirts, and shorts, to soft and gentle fabrics perfect for newborns, UNIQLO has just what you need for your kids\u2019 wardrobes. <br><br><br>Shop seasonal kids\u2019 clothing collections, featuring streetwear-inspired designs and limited-edition collaborations, all exclusive to UNIQLO.<br><br><br> \ud83d\udc5a\ud83d\udc55Save your favorite clothing styles <br><br><br>Tag clothes you like as \u201cFavorites\u201d and keep a collection of looks you love.<br><br><br>Get notified when items you\u2019ve tagged as favorites are available for pickup, back in stock, or on sale.<br><br><br>Keep adding your favorite clothes to your collection for more personalized style recommendations.<br><br><br>\ud83c\udfa5Clothes-sizing videos <br><br><br>See styles up close with product videos that give you a detailed look at the cut and fabric, giving you a more realistic idea of how clothes fit. <br><br><br>\ud83d\udccfMySize ASSIST<br><br><br>Take the guesswork out of sizing with MySize Assistant.<br><br><br>Simply enter your body measurements and preferred fit, and we\u2019ll recommend a clothing size that\u2019s perfect for you.<br><br><br>\ud83c\udfecEasy in-store pickups<br> <br>Save on shipping costs and skip store queues when you shop for clothes and other products using the app. <br><br><br>Choose &quot;Ship to Store&quot; on your checkout screen and collect your new styles from any UNIQLO store that suits you within 1 hour, completely free of charge. <br><br><br>See when products are out of stock online but available in-store and swing by for a swift, same-day pick-up. <br><br><br>Avoid the disappointment of a wasted trip by checking whether a new product or special offer item is in stock before you visit your favorite store.<br><br><br>\u23f0Back-in-stock notifications<br><br><br>Get alerts sent straight to your phone and be the first to know when the clothing style you\u2019ve been eyeing is back in stock.<br><br><br>\ud83d\udd0eUNIQLO product scanner<br><br><br>Use the app to scan product barcodes at home or in store and easily check if nearby stores have your perfect size and fit. <br><br><br>\ud83e\udd11 App-exclusive offers  <br><br><br>Download UNIQLO and unlock $10 off your first purchase of $75 or more\u2014new customers only.<br>Scan your app member ID at checkout to unlock exclusive, member-only discounts. <br><br><br>\ud83c\udf33 Save time\u2014and the planet\u2014with e-receipts<br><br><br>Opt for e-receipts at checkout to easily track your shopping history right from the app.<br><br><br>Return or exchange clothing and other items using electronic receipts, saving you the hassle of keeping track of paper receipts.<br><br><br>\ud83d\udce3Have your say<br><br><br>Share feedback on items you\u2019ve bought with the UNIQLO team and keep a lookout for product improvements. <br><br><br>Read reviews from customers who have bought the same products as you. See the star rating, gender, height, weight and age of the customer who posted the review to help you choose the perfect product.<br><br><br>\u2139\ufe0f UNIQLO customer care<br><br><br>Chat with a UNIQLO representative for assistance with all your clothes and shopping needs.",
